<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barley major sales activity in the week ended Oct 10 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p>Mexico	     -600		    Nil</p>
<p>Exports of 13,000 tonnes were down 17 percent from the previous week and 61 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>The major export destination was Mexico (13,000)</p>
</text>
